// Component spells. Individually unremarkable on purpose -- what makes them
// interesting is what they do to the other components in the bag.
//
// `art` is 3 lines of at most 7 columns, so five cards fit across an 80-column
// terminal. `blurb` says what the component contributes to a combination.
